{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to Python 3 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 8 code to Python 3 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 8 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class DStress2 {\n\n\tvoid solve() {\n\t\t int n = in.nextInt();\n\t\t String s = in.nextToken();\n\t\t out.println(solve(s.toCharArray()));\n\t}\n\n\tvoid stress() {\n\t\tRandom rng = new Random(123);\n\t\tfor (int IT = 0; IT < 10000; IT++) {\n\t\t\tint n = 1 + rng.nextInt(12);\n\t\t\tchar[] c = new char[n];\n\t\t\tfor (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n\t\t\t\tc[i] = \"AVK\".charAt(rng.nextInt(3));\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\tint ans1 = solve(c);\n\t\t\tint ans2 = stupid(c);\n\t\t\tif (ans1 != ans2) {\n\t\t\t\tSystem.err.println(IT + \" \" + ans1 + \" \" + ans2 + \" \" + new String(c));\n\t\t\t\tbreak;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\tint INF = Integer.MAX_VALUE / 3;\n\n\tint stupid(char[] s) {\n\t\tString st = new String(s);\n\t\tQueue<String> q = new ArrayDeque<>();\n\t\tMap<String, Integer> dist = new HashMap<>();\n\t\tq.add(st);\n\t\tdist.put(st, 0);\n\t\twhile (!q.isEmpty()) {\n\t\t\tst = q.poll();\n\t\t\tint cur = dist.get(st);\n\t\t\tif (!st.contains(\"VK\")) {\n\t\t\t\treturn cur;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\tfor (int pos = 0; pos < st.length() - 1; pos++) {\n\t\t\t\tString next = st.substring(0, pos) + st.charAt(pos + 1) + st.charAt(pos) + st.substring(pos + 2);\n\t\t\t\tif (!dist.containsKey(next)) {\n\t\t\t\t\tdist.put(next, cur + 1);\n\t\t\t\t\tq.add(next);\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\treturn 0;\n\t}\n\n\tint solve(char[] s) {\n\t\tList<Integer> vPos = new ArrayList<>(), kPos = new ArrayList<>(), otherPos = new ArrayList<>();\n\n\t\tfor (int i = 0; i < s.length; i++) {\n\t\t\tif (s[i] == 'V') {\n\t\t\t\tvPos.add(i);\n\t\t\t} else if (s[i] == 'K') {\n\t\t\t\tkPos.add(i);\n\t\t\t} else {\n\t\t\t\totherPos.add(i);\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\t\n\t\tint[][][][] dp = new int[2][vPos.size() + 1][kPos.size() + 1][otherPos.size() + 1];\n\t\t\n\t\tfor (int[][][] i : dp) {\n\t\t\tfor (int[][] j : i) {\n\t\t\t\tfor (int[] k : j) {\n\t\t\t\t\tArrays.fill(k, INF);\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\tdp[0][0][0][0] = 0;\n\t\t\n\t\tfor (int V = 0; V <= vPos.size(); V++) {\n\t\t\tfor (int K = 0; K <= kPos.size(); K++) {\n\t\t\t\tfor (int O = 0; O <= otherPos.size(); O++) {\n\t\t\t\t\tfor (int last = 0; last < 2; last++) {\n\t\t\t\t\t\tint cur = dp[last][V][K][O];\n\t\t\t\t\t\tif (cur == INF) {\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcontinue;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\t\tif (V < vPos.size()) {\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tint costV = 0;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfor (int idx = 0; idx < kPos.size(); idx++) {\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tif (kPos.get(idx) < vPos.get(V)) costV++;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfor (int idx = 0; idx < otherPos.size(); idx++) {\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tif (otherPos.get(idx) < vPos.get(V)) costV++;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdp[1][V + 1][K][O] = Math.min(dp[1][V + 1][K][O], cur + costV);\n\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\t\tif (K < kPos.size() && last == 0) {\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tint costK = 0;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfor (int idx = 0; idx < vPos.size(); idx++) {\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tif (vPos.get(idx) < kPos.get(K)) costK++;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfor (int idx = 0; idx < otherPos.size(); idx++) {\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tif (otherPos.get(idx) < kPos.get(K)) costK++;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdp[0][V][K + 1][O] = Math.min(dp[0][V][K + 1][O], cur + costK);\n\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\t\tif (O < otherPos.size()) {\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tint costO = 0;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfor (int idx = 0; idx < vPos.size(); idx++) {\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tif (vPos.get(idx) < otherPos.get(O)) costO++;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfor (int idx = 0; idx < kPos.size(); idx++) {\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tif (kPos.get(idx) < otherPos.get(O)) costO++;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdp[0][V][K][O + 1] = Math.min(dp[0][V][K][O + 1], cur + costO);\n\t\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\t\n\t\treturn Math.min(dp[0][vPos.size()][kPos.size()][otherPos.size()], dp[1][vPos.size()][kPos.size()][otherPos.size()]);\n\t}\n\n\tFastScanner in;\n\tPrintWriter out;\n\n\tvoid run() {\n\t\tin = new FastScanner();\n\t\tout = new PrintWriter(System.out);\n\t\tsolve();\n\t\tout.close();\n\t}\n\n\tstatic class FastScanner {\n\t\tBufferedReader br;\n\t\tStringTokenizer st;\n\n\t\tpublic FastScanner() {\n\t\t\tbr = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n\t\t}\n\n\t\tpublic FastScanner(String s) {\n\t\t\ttry {\n\t\t\t\tbr = new BufferedReader(new FileReader(s));\n\t\t\t} catch (FileNotFoundException e) {\n\t\t\t\te.printStackTrace();\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\n\t\tpublic String nextToken() {\n\t\t\twhile (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n\t\t\t\ttry {\n\t\t\t\t\tst = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n\t\t\t\t} catch (IOException e) {\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\treturn st.nextToken();\n\t\t}\n\n\t\tpublic int nextInt() {\n\t\t\treturn Integer.parseInt(nextToken());\n\t\t}\n\n\t\tpublic long nextLong() {\n\t\t\treturn Long.parseLong(nextToken());\n\t\t}\n\n\t\tpublic double nextDouble() {\n\t\t\treturn Double.parseDouble(nextToken());\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\tpublic static void main(String[] args) {\n\t\tnew DStress2().run();\n\t}\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport sys\nfrom collections import deque\nimport random\n\nclass FastScanner:\n    def __init__(self, input_file=None):\n        if input_file is None:\n            self.br = sys.stdin\n        else:\n            try:\n                self.br = open(input_file, 'r')\n            except FileNotFoundError:\n                import traceback\n                traceback.print_exc()\n        self.st = None\n\n    def next_token(self):\n        while self.st is None or not self.st:\n            try:\n                line = self.br.readline()\n                if not line:\n                    return None\n                self.st = line.split()\n            except Exception:\n                pass\n        return self.st.pop(0)\n\n    def next_int(self):\n        token = self.next_token()\n        return int(token) if token is not None else None\n\nclass DStress2:\n    def solve(self):\n        n = self.in_.next_int()\n        s = self.in_.next_token()\n        print(self.solve_char_array(list(s)))\n\n    def stress(self):\n        rng = random.Random(123)\n        for IT in range(10000):\n            n = 1 + rng.randint(0, 11)\n            c = []\n            for i in range(n):\n                c.append(\"AVK\"[rng.randint(0, 2)])\n            \n            ans1 = self.solve_char_array(c)\n            ans2 = self.stupid(c)\n            if ans1 != ans2:\n                print(f\"{IT} {ans1} {ans2} {''.join(c)}\", file=sys.stderr)\n                break\n\n    INF = float('inf')\n\n    def stupid(self, s):\n        st = ''.join(s)\n        q = deque()\n        dist = {}\n        q.append(st)\n        dist[st] = 0\n        while q:\n            st = q.popleft()\n            cur = dist[st]\n            if \"VK\" not in st:\n                return cur\n            \n            for pos in range(len(st) - 1):\n                next_str = st[:pos] + st[pos+1] + st[pos] + st[pos+2:]\n                if next_str not in dist:\n                    dist[next_str] = cur + 1\n                    q.append(next_str)\n        return 0\n\n    def solve_char_array(self, s):\n        vPos = []\n        kPos = []\n        otherPos = []\n        \n        for i in range(len(s)):\n            if s[i] == 'V':\n                vPos.append(i)\n            elif s[i] == 'K':\n                kPos.append(i)\n            else:\n                otherPos.append(i)\n        \n        # Initialize dp array with INF\n        dp = [[[[self.INF for _ in range(len(otherPos) + 2)] for _ in range(len(kPos) + 2)] for _ in range(len(vPos) + 2)] for _ in range(2)]\n        dp[0][0][0][0] = 0\n        \n        for V in range(len(vPos) + 1):\n            for K in range(len(kPos) + 1):\n                for O in range(len(otherPos) + 1):\n                    for last in range(2):\n                        cur = dp[last][V][K][O]\n                        if cur == self.INF:\n                            continue\n                        if V < len(vPos):\n                            costV = 0\n                            for idx in range(len(kPos)):\n                                if kPos[idx] < vPos[V]:\n                                    costV += 1\n                            for idx in range(len(otherPos)):\n                                if otherPos[idx] < vPos[V]:\n                                    costV += 1\n                            dp[1][V + 1][K][O] = min(dp[1][V + 1][K][O], cur + costV)\n                        if K < len(kPos) and last == 0:\n                            costK = 0\n                            for idx in range(len(vPos)):\n                                if vPos[idx] < kPos[K]:\n                                    costK += 1\n                            for idx in range(len(otherPos)):\n                                if otherPos[idx] < kPos[K]:\n                                    costK += 1\n                            dp[0][V][K + 1][O] = min(dp[0][V][K + 1][O], cur + costK)\n                        if O < len(otherPos):\n                            costO = 0\n                            for idx in range(len(vPos)):\n                                if vPos[idx] < otherPos[O]:\n                                    costO += 1\n                            for idx in range(len(kPos)):\n                                if kPos[idx] < otherPos[O]:\n                                    costO += 1\n                            dp[0][V][K][O + 1] = min(dp[0][V][K][O + 1], cur + costO)\n        \n        return min(dp[0][len(vPos)][len(kPos)][len(otherPos)], dp[1][len(vPos)][len(kPos)][len(otherPos)])\n\n    def run(self):\n        self.in_ = FastScanner()\n        self.solve()\n        # No need to close stdin\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    DStress2().run()\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-8.844937838148326e-05, -5.960462772236497e-07, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.00011908298620255664, -0.002090651309117675, -3.4570634852570947e-06, -0.5759543180465698, -0.0003182381624355912, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.0007217901293188334, -0.5408980846405029, -0.10020733624696732, -0.16922079026699066, -0.3162481486797333, -0.09174153953790665, -0.47479939460754395, -7.748573807475623e-06, -5.125986263010418e-06, -1.1205610462639015e-05, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -4.768360213347478e-06, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -4.768370445162873e-07, -6.556489552167477e-06, -0.22542062401771545, -0.015216105617582798, -0.6896481513977051, -0.0004175029753241688, -1.6689286894688848e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -4.565611743601039e-05, -1.1920922133867862e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.12693476676940918, -0.0006295844214037061, -5.960462772236497e-07, -7.152555099310121e-07, -3.814689989667386e-06, -0.0023334198631346226, -1.6689286894688848e-06, -2.47952248173533e-05, -1.311301275563892e-06, -4.458328112377785e-05, -0.00020346954988781363, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -3.576278118089249e-07, -5.960462772236497e-07, -0.14268304407596588, 0.0, -1.7165990357170813e-05, -7.152555099310121e-07, -2.9802276912960224e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-0